      "role": "user",
      "content": "thx. i get what u mean about the balance. but honestly, when i talk to other people about this, it seems like the \"confusion\" argument is mostly just people being resistant to change or not wanting to be inclusive. is there actually any valid evidence that it messes up productivity or communication, or is it mostly just a social/political thing?",
